\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different gamemodes like capture the flag or fight in arenas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310180/extras/93b8edd5f761343e9ba6972004d82d84.poster.avif?t=1787449919\" width=574 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310180/extras/93b8edd5f761343e9ba6972004d82d84.webm?t=1787449919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4310180/extras/93b8edd5f761343e9ba6972004d82d84.mp4?t=1787449919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Chaotic Ragdoll Physics</strong><br>Every movement, punch, and explosion creates unpredictable, hilarious moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧍 <strong>Third-Person Combat</strong><br>Run, jump, climb, grab enemies, and throw them across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💣 <strong>Ridiculous Weapons</strong><br>Launch rockets, trigger explosions, and send players flying.<br>👥 <strong>Up to 12 Players Multiplayer</strong><br>Total chaos with friends or strangers in wild online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Multiple Game Modes</strong><br><br><br><br><strong>Free-For-All</strong> – Last wobbler standing wins<br>Capture-The-Flag - Capture the enemies teams flag and bring it to your base.<br>And much more incoming<br><br><br>Please be sure to wishlist this project as its a one man team, would appreciate it a lot :D</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BROBONK is a active ragdoll phyisics combat game featuring up to 12 players in multiplayer so you can play against friends or randoms  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dismember others or yourself[/p]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >